#tr.en: speak! 
3. um-ma {d}utu-na-s,i-ir-ma 
#tr.en: Thus Šamaš-nāṣir; 
4. {d}utu u3 {d}marduk tu-ba-al-li-t,u2-ka 
#tr.en: may Šamaš and Marduk keep you well! 
